# Audi A6 C8 four-door saloon, 2018 onwards.
#
# The fifth A6: the C8 body with the wider, lower single-frame grille, the
# sharp OLED-style lamps and the mild-hybrid range. Audi UK announced it in
# summer 2018. The Avant and allroad are different bodies.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Audi_A6
#
# Dimensions 4.939 x 1.886 x 1.457 m, wheelbase 2.924 m.
#
# Shape reference: image 1 is a near-level broadside of a C8 S line; the
# front and rear three-quarters show the lamps and tail.
#
# Colours: grade (d); no UK chart was established. Black, silver, grey and
# blue are plain names. Weights 15, 13, 12, 10, total 50, provisional.
#
# Speed 240 km/h. Comfort 98/327, on the line 180 + 1.5 x 98. Classes 3,4.
# Dates are road presence: 2018 intro, retires staggered 2042-2045.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/audi-a6-c8.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/audi-a6-c8.dae. References:
# citycars/references/audi-a6-c8/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: the wheel design and the S line bumper's corner blades
# are simplified, and the full-width tail bar is a flat red band without the
# inner lens graphics or corner wrap. The family shape is simplified and the
# rear window more upright than the photograph's. At 128 px the wide flat grille,
# slim lamps and full-width tail bar read as a C8 A6.


obj=citycar
name=AudiA6C8(Black)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=15
intro_year=2018
intro_month=6
retire_year=2045
retire_month=6
speed=240
